<section class="p-hero"><div class="p-hero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calc-desk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calc-desk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calc-desk.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.15"></div><div class="wrap p-hero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Calculators</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for Pennsylvania</h1><p class="lede">7 calculators and planners shaped by real appraisal work. Use them to understand your claim, check the carrier’s math and plan the next step — no sign-up, nothing stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="t-grid" data-stagger><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-projector/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calc-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calc-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calc-papers.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="749" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">Δ</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Calculator</span><h2 class="h3">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Projector</h2><span class="t-txt">Size the dispute, test where an award could land and subtract appraiser and umpire fees to see your net.</span></span></a><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/interior.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/interior-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/interior.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">ACV</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Calculator</span><h2 class="h3">RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><span class="t-txt">Split a replacement cost claim into the first ACV check, the recoverable holdback and the total after repairs.</span></span></a><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-slate.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-slate-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-slate.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">▲</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Calculator</span><h2 class="h3">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</h2><span class="t-txt">Turn a footprint and pitch into true roof squares, bundles and a rough cost to check the carrier’s measurements.</span></span></a><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/deductible-impact-calculator/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">%</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Calculator</span><h2 class="h3">Deductible Impact Calculator</h2><span class="t-txt">Convert a percentage deductible into dollars and see how much of a storm loss your policy would actually pay.</span></span></a><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/claim-deadline-calendar/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="802" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">◷</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Planner</span><h2 class="h3">Claim Deadline Calendar</h2><span class="t-txt">Map notice, proof-of-loss, holdback and one-year suit dates from your date of loss, then export them.</span></span></a><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspector.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspector-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspector.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Checklist</span><h2 class="h3">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><span class="t-txt">Answer twelve yes/no questions to score your claim file and get a to-do list before demanding appraisal.</span></span></a><a class="t-card rv" href="/claim-calculators/roof-snow-load-estimator/"><span class="t-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roofs.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roofs-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roofs.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="t-ic" aria-hidden="true">❄</span></span><span class="t-b"><span class="t-kind">Estimator</span><h2 class="h3">Roof Snow Load Estimator</h2><span class="t-txt">Estimate the weight of fresh snow, settled snow and ice on your roof and compare it with a design load.</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the calculators together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li><a href="/claim-calculators/claim-deadline-calendar/">Claim Deadline Calendar</a> — calendar the suit and holdback dates first</li><li><a href="/claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</a> — check the roof measurements</li><li><a href="/claim-calculators/roof-snow-load-estimator/">Roof Snow Load Estimator</a> — if winter weight played a part</li><li><a href="/claim-calculators/deductible-impact-calculator/">Deductible Impact Calculator</a> — see what the deductible takes</li><li><a href="/claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</a> — split RCV, ACV and holdback</li><li><a href="/claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-projector/">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Projector</a> — test whether the dispute is worth fees</li><li><a href="/claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</a> — finish with a file checkup</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through, free</h2><p>Tell us what the carrier offered. We’ll say honestly whether appraisal makes sense.</p><a class="side-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm ET</small></div></div></div></section>
